  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-04-10T19:03:33.716Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A friend of mine and me are working on a Map for VRChat right now.\nWe've added some cool mechanics already and our Bossfight has very advanced mechanics.\nWe've added some different weapons. Every weapon has a set of Skills that can be used by using Keys (Keys 1-5 right now).\nEverything works kinda fine so far... for Desktop Users. Desktop Users can use these Skills when they pickup the weapons and use the Keyboard Keys (OnKeyDown-Trigger). Unfortunately VR-Users are unable to use this skills right now.\nIs there a way to implement hand gestures to the triggers so VR-Users can use the skills by doing different Hand gestures?\n\nWould be cool if you can help us out.\n\no/",
